<description>&lt;p&gt;A former Hurras al-Din commander was arrested in Idlib, and Syrian officials warned that Druze groups, allegedly backed by Israel, may launch an offensive in Sweida. The YPJ said it remains a guarantee for security as Syria proceeds with its integration process, while defense universities limited women’s admission to most programs, a policy condemned by HRW. Jordan’s king reaffirmed support for Syria’s sovereignty and the Syrian Kurdish community expressed a preference for Bashar al-Assad over Erdogan. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNaGoyTzNYbWdxaE5UVk5PQnVQTWV0SlJuZURpRWkwa1dwMTk4ZzluVFU2WXNJckkyNHBYaHNJWmNDWmJHbmtCYkJoNVFVOHZJSkhlcmxVQ1dUMk0yRVF6YWtVQTBNMjA0QnA3Wlp5NHdaanFFQjhEck5WcVVObk1LNzdodDJYNzE0SjY1UC1RMGo5QXhJc1ItdmNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;i24NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE9WcjltM0tfQllMbENvLXJCTDBKUWRrT2tDVTlsSFlOUGZseGdwTUlNNDFTR1NaOThDRWV5SDlOdXllWHdUalBOSmRvbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQamFFT3hMRnpRbkdlTXNJaEdFeElxWE13Ymk4UEhlS3RicjR1M01mSWtsSWpLdTY3SXVrTnRRNXpXZE9mWDBaUENLdnFPRlZ6M01FVVJWOG5fMWVkdXhkS0VKUXluQlJTYmtHdHIzNWpqbmt2MWFRaU9ZQXcwZmU5RnRqMnp3RlZTakFYZ2NyTFM5ZEZILWlsa0tpUjl3UUpqVnBsWkl4MXg0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQUF82VDBEM3VYZmV5UGVRNnhVM2J3TVBEVk56TGVrczdLV01FNm1NWFBVYXdKOFRKM2xMMU1FRUVBOTcxVTVaNkwtV0xVS1dYTlFxdnQ2RktMZ3FxMnhObUJWM0E5c1NmQTVHMXBTOU44NE1CTDRjZGdxSWpLM1RCSlVfWEUtWFZXRVBrY3ZaUHN0bS1HTXQxd21iSkdWWTBEeDZqa0NaTUJCbFd4N1ROSzRFNldqWGt4aUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 